      "writtenOn": "2018-10-18T23:23:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "New implementation with hw timer will be like this:\n\n#define I2C_TX_FLUSH_TIMEOUT 200;\n\n\texpire_ts \u003d __hw_clock_source_read() + I2C_TX_FLUSH_TIMEOUT;\n\n\tif (in_size \u003e (ISH_I2C_FIFO_SIZE - out_size)) {\n\t\t\n\t\twhile ((i2c_mmio_read(ctx-\u003ebase, IC_STATUS) \u0026\n\t\t\t(1 \u003c\u003c IC_STATUS_TFE)) \u003d\u003d 0) {\n\n\t\t\tif (__hw_clock_source_read() \u003e\u003d expire_ts) {\n\t\t\t\tctx-\u003eerror_flag \u003d 1;\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tCPU_RELAX();\n\t\t}\n\t}",
      "parentUuid": "eb9bd585_a5e8a616",
